<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade very slow. Not enough slaughter steer or heifer sales confirmed for an adequate market test Monday.</p>
<p>Inquiry moderate, demand fair.</p>
<p>Sales confirmed on 200 slaughter steers and 200 slaughter heifers Monday.</p>
<p>For the week to date 4500 head confirmed, mostly previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers Few Select and Choice 2-3 1250-1275 lbs 63.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers Few Select and Choice 2-3 1050 lbs 63.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed     400 last week  6500 last year 5000</p>
<p>Week to date 4500 last week 58000 last year 8700</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
